  - Fuel Policy Fee: $14.46 (if not returned full)
  - No mileage fees (unlimited)
- **Free Cancellation**: Yes, up to 48 hours before pick-up
- **What's Included**:
  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)
  - Theft Cover
  - Third-Party Liability (TPL) insurance
  - Amendments allowed
- **Optional Add-Ons**:
